{"id":"f21d04ffa9b76787","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-partial-isomorphism.md","title":"Partial Isomorphisms","display":"df-partial-isomorphism — Partial Isomorphisms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-partial-isomorphism","aliases":["17-df-partial-isomorphism"],"display":"df-partial-isomorphism — Partial Isomorphisms","depends_on":["[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-atomic-formula]]","[[17-df-free-variable]]","[[17-df-type]]","[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]","[[17-df-set-functions]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive","source_verification":"local reconstruction from supplied book-17 usage; not a transcription of missing upstream files"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-partial-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-partial-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-isomorphism — Partial Isomorphisms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b456e6677109f36b\" href=\"?note=b456e6677109f36b\" title=\"17-df-atomic-formula\">17-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"local reconstruction from supplied book-17 usage; not a transcription of missing upstream files"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为候选函数图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\operatorname{dom}(p)\">\\(D=\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\)</span>。原子公式和自由变量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b456e6677109f36b\" href=\"?note=b456e6677109f36b\" title=\"17-df-atomic-formula\">17-df-atomic-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\)</span> 及有限元组满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a:n\\to D\">\\(\\bar a:n\\to D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\circ\\bar a\">\\(p\\circ\\bar a\\)</span> 为复合元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartIso}\">\\(\\operatorname{PartIso}\\)</span> 只在固定语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 下省略下标。空部分映射允许作候选，但仍须保持无自由变量的原子句。定义不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 对函数符号封闭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PartIso}_L(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;p\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\times|\\mathfrak B|\n\\land\\operatorname{Inj}(p,\\operatorname{dom}(p),|\\mathfrak B|)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\\cap\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)^n\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[p\\circ\\bar a]\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PartIso}_L(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PartIso}_L(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;p\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\times|\\mathfrak B|\n\\land\\operatorname{Inj}(p,\\operatorname{dom}(p),|\\mathfrak B|)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\\cap\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)^n\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[p\\circ\\bar a]\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PartIso}_L(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关系语言中这是诱导有限子结构间同构的通常部分映射形式；有函数的语言中，以含项的全部原子公式明确保持条件，避免把未封闭的有限定义域误当子结构。该接口足以支持本册可数来回论证；Fraïssé 超齐性仍对实际有限子结构使用普通同构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fd