ak A,\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&p\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\times|\\mathfrak B|\n\\land\\operatorname{Inj}(p,\\operatorname{dom}(p),|\\mathfrak B|)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L\\cap\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)^n\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[p\\circ\\bar a]\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n&\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PartIso}_L(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2101,"backlinks":[{"id":"fc4d04472af291f6","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$K$ 是以固定集合论公式给出的 $L$-结构元类；涉及 $K$ 的量词是该公式的受限量词展开，而非 ZFC 中对真类的量化。$K_0$ 是一个集合，承担可数同构代表集的角色。$\\operatorname{PartIso}$、$\\cong_L$ 的语言始终为此处固定的 $L$，见 [[17-df-partial-isomorphism]]、[[17-df-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"dd42e4c43322822e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartIso}$ and $\\cong$ (partial isomorphism and isomorphism, see [[17-df-partial-isomorphism]] and [[17-df-isomorphism]])"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-partial-isomorphism]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-isomorphism]]\n[[17-df-language-operations]]\n[[17-df-lindstrom-regularity]]\n[[17-df-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]\n[[17-df-partial-isomorphism]]\n[[17-df-partition-relation]]\n[[17-df-set-functions]]\n[[17-df-simultaneous-substitution]]\n[[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]"},{"id":"0b9cf711d9f53336","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../17-df-partial-isomorphism|17-df-partial-isomorphism]]"}],"outgoing":["fdac0